  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place potato and Mumbai spice blend on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, toss to coat and spread out evenly.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-660277d8b8d1e1d58ab30cf9-25ff4190.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, peel and slice orange into thin wedges. Grate carrot (see ingredients).\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-660277d8b8d1e1d58ab30cf9-e776aa4c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the potato has 5 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi, until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add sweet chilli sauce, turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-660277d8b8d1e1d58ab30cf9-2f871409.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, carrot and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season.\n• Divide sweet chilli-glazed haloumi, Bombay potatoes and orange salad between plates.\n• Garnish with crushed peanuts and serve with garlic aioli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-660277d8b8d1e1d58ab30cf9-f4ca784a.jpeg"
    }
  ]
